+        // Reverses renderChatMarkdown(), so a previously-written export file can be
+        // read back and merged with a freshly-scraped window -- see mergeEntries().
+        // A header line is "**sender** _time_"; every following "> "-prefixed line
+        // until the next header (or end of file) is that entry's text, rejoined with
+        // "\n". This only needs to round-trip what renderChatMarkdown() itself
